  "summary": "As a Software Engineer with 10 years of experience, I design and build distributed backend systems and data platforms that support large-scale, business-critical operations.\nMy experience spans backend architecture, microservices, APIs, event-driven systems, data engineering, financial and tax platforms, and high-volume transaction processing, with technologies including Java, Kafka, and cloud-based platforms.\nI focus on systems where reliability, accuracy, scalability, performance, and auditability are essential. \nI enjoy breaking down complex technical and business problems into resilient, maintainable solutions.My approach combines strong system design, pragmatic engineering, and close collaboration across product, business, and engineering teams.\nI’m also focused on advancing AI-assisted engineering and LLM-enabled development practices, evolving software development workflows to improve productivity, consistency, and engineering quality at scale.",
