    "description": "• Architected a large-scale transaction-ingestion pipeline using CDC, Kafka, Iceberg, and Spark, reducing manual preparation and supporting reliable tax-year reporting.\n\n• Engineered core components of a self-billing platform for international tax and compliance workflows, including APIs, eligibility logic, persistence, provider integration, and end-to-end validation.\n\n• Expanded AI-assisted engineering across multiple repositories and technology stacks by advancing spec-driven development practices and shared tooling.\n\n• Built and supported large-scale tax compliance systems spanning transaction collection, calculation, reconciliation, reporting, recovery, and production data corrections.\n\n• Designed a governed architecture for AI-assisted tax investigations with access controls, sensitive-data masking, and audit logging.\n\n• Developed backend ordering services and financial data flows supporting a global commerce platform across multiple markets and currencies.",
